+---
+"effect": patch
+---
+
+Fix a slow `RpcClient` stream consumer stalling every other request on a socket or worker connection. A stream whose buffer is full now holds back only its own chunks, by withholding its `Ack`, so replies, other streams, and pongs keep arriving.
